{"id":"takoj","lemma":"такой","pos":"pron","rank":116,"glosses":["like that, like this (sometimes translated as simply \"that\"/\"those\"\" or \"this\"/\"these\")","such (in such a way that the following clause is true)","as, the way, like (in the way described in the following clause)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/31/Ru-%D1%82%D0%B0%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B9.ogg/Ru-%D1%82%D0%B0%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B9.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ты такой видел?","en":"Did you see one like this?","words":[{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"to see","l":"видеть"}]},{"text":"Том что, всегда такой?","en":"Tom is always like that, isn't he?","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"always"},null]},{"text":"Я не такой, как ты.","en":"I'm not like you.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"how / like"},{"g":"you"}]},{"text":"Я действительно такой плохой?","en":"Am I really that bad?","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"really"},null,{"g":"bad"}]},{"text":"Такой вот он.","en":"That's the way he is.","words":[null,{"g":"here is"},{"g":"he / it"}]}]}